                      (        forth.asm):00297         * extent they are ROM resident--not to mention inter-word dependencies),
                      (        forth.asm):00298         * might still be overridden by user definitions. WORDS will happily ignore
                      (        forth.asm):00299         * that fact and list everything in the dictionary linked list order.
